		{
			dependencies: [
				"7522632161D258AA"
				"63F1C9A1095AEC1E"
			]
			description: [
				"Pressing blood into drinkable blood! Fully automatic! Mostly automatic.. "
				""
				"Putting a grinder above a sieve should automate the production of drinkable blood. While I can extract the blood from most meat in the sieve, the blood is not fully pure, but it's drinkable. I should place a tank under the grinder so that blood flows down there, easy for collection."
				""
				"I shouldn't try to mix unpure blood and pure blood, this is a bad idea."
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "34B4063F2F210048"
			rewards: [
				{
					exclude_from_claim_all: true
