				"02ECCCD98242956B"
			]
			description: [
				"By modifying a meat grinder, I can now get it to crush metal and meat alike."
				""
				"&4Meat scraps should prove to be useful. I have a recipe or two for materials made from flesh."
				""
				"I estimate this is a net improvement over the hydraulic crusher. This jaw crusher can hover between 1.77x and 2.22x ore processing if I'm lucky enough. For now, this is sufficient for raw ore, but I believe that later on, I can process raw ore blocks further."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"This crusher now requires power, which can be supplied by a stirling engine. It will drop its output in front of itself. Perhaps I should place a hopper to automatically collect it."
			]
