				}
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: 0.5d
			y: -2.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["623C14C05294EFCC"]
			description: [
				"Hey Grisha, would you have an idea as to how I could.. obtain more food while doing other things? This takes too much of my time."
				""
				"&4You want to drink fish blood? What's wrong with you?"
				""
				"No, for regular food. I would never drink fish blood in my life! Eww!"
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&4Then, a regular fish trap is simple enough. Shouldn't you know this? It's quite obvious. "
				""
				"&4Make a box out of canvas and sticks then attach a hook inside. Place your bait on the hook. Without a bait, you'll only catch random river junk. Make sure the fish trap is in a river or in the ocean."
				""
				"&4Let me search inside of my pages for a moment.. Bread as bait will yield you any fish. Cods especially like beetroots. Salmon especially like berries. Tropical fish especially like melon."
				""
				"&a(The Fish trap needs to be in a river or ocean biome.)"
			]
			entity_vis_size: 1.0f
			id: "5002D4D86529E236"
			rewards: [{
				id: "168B238869815F8A"
				type: "xp_levels"
				xp_levels: 1
			}]
			tasks: [{
				id: "1D4722689FD0C6D4"
				item: "fishermens_trap:fishtrap"
				type: "item"
			}]
			x: -4.5d
			y: -2.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1E9B68675477C2B1"]
			description: [
				"&o&7Notes from Eleonore's Travels, Tome II"
				""
				"&fMeteorite clumps can be turned into frail but still effective tools. These do not have the highest durability or mining speed, but boast a mining level as impressive as diamond."
				""
				"&fThe most notable quality of these tools is the innate magnetism they possess. Any meteorite tool will naturally attract nearby items, in a range of around five blocks, to itself."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&fThe Meteorite Broadaxe is one of the special meteorite tools alongside the Meteorite Longsword. Apprentice Technicians enjoy making these special tool types to one-up their Hermit comrades. "
				""
				"&fThe Meteorite Broadaxe has the special ability to cut three logs at once and draw them to its wielder, due to the innate magnetism of the axe. Using a lesser quantity of meteorite for the regular meteorite axe limits it to cutting only one log."
			]
